{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34461","headline":"和袭美醉中即席赠润卿博士次韵 · 陆龟蒙","name":"和袭美醉中即席赠润卿博士次韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"共是虚皇简上仙，清词如羽欲飘然。\n登山凡着几緉屐，破浪欲乘千里船。\n远梦只留丹井畔，闲吟多在酒旗前。\n谁知海上无名者，只记渔歌不记年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34461.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34461","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}